(  410) !                  -------------------------------------------------
(  411) 
(  412) DO JK=KLEV-1,3,-1
(  413) 
(  414) !                  SPECIFY CLOUD BASE VALUES FOR MIDLEVEL CONVECTION
(  415) !                  IN *CUBASMC* IN CASE THERE IS NOT ALREADY CONVECTION
(  416) !                  ----------------------------------------------------
(  417) 
(  418)   IK=JK
